{"id":28768,"slug":"wrong-move","title":"Wrong Move","year":1975,"country":"Germany","duration":104,"spine":815,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28768-wrong-move","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/2a6e66f164ce8c878e2854fb4bf18eea/53yqUVmZXKZMw5AmKwBr2OoIdQz2nV_large.jpg","description":"With depth and style, Wim Wenders updates a late-eighteenth-century novel by Goethe, transposing it to 1970s West Germany and giving us the story of an aimless writer (Rüdiger Vogler) who leaves his hometown to find himself and winds up befriending a group of other travelers. Seeking inspiration to help him escape his creative funk, he instead discovers the limits of attempts to refashion one’s identity. One of the director’s least seen but earthiest and most devastating soul searches, Wrong Move features standout supporting performances from New German Cinema regulars Hanna Schygulla and Peter Kern and, in her first film appearance, Nastassja Kinski. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Wim Wenders","slug":"wim-wenders"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Rüdiger Vogler","role":"Wilhelm Meister","slug":"rudiger-vogler-2"},{"actor":"Hans Christian Blech","role":"Laertes","slug":"hans-christian-blech"},{"actor":"Hanna Schygulla","role":"Therese Farner","slug":"hanna-schygulla"},{"actor":"Nastassja Kinski","role":"Mignon","slug":"nastassja-kinski"},{"actor":"Peter Kern","role":"Bernhard Landau","slug":"peter-kern"},{"actor":"Ivan Desny","role":"The industrialist","slug":"ivan-desny"},{"actor":"Marianne Hoppe","role":"The mother","slug":"marianne-hoppe"},{"actor":"Elisabeth Kreuzer","role":"Janine","slug":"elisabeth-kreuzer"},{"actor":"Adolph Hansen","role":"Schaffner","slug":"adolph-hansen"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Wim Wenders","slug":"wim-wenders"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Peter Genée","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay (based on Goethe’s Wilhelm Meister’s Apprenticeship)","person":"Peter Handke","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay (based on G